@startuml 时序图

participant "用户浏览器/客户端" as Client
participant "Web 前端" as Frontend
participant "API 网关" as APIGW
participant "Auth 服务" as AuthSvc
participant "Product 服务" as ProductSvc
participant "Image 存储 (OSS/S3)" as ImageStore
participant "主数据库" as DB
participant "Search 索引 (ES)" as ES

Client -> Frontend : 填写商品信息 + 选择图片
Client -> Frontend : 点击「发布」
Frontend -> APIGW : POST /api/products (含 token + 商品数据)
APIGW -> AuthSvc : 验证 token
AuthSvc --> APIGW : token 有效 / 用户ID
APIGW -> ProductSvc : createProduct(payload, userId)
ProductSvc -> ImageStore : upload images
ImageStore --> ProductSvc : 返回 image URLs
ProductSvc -> DB : INSERT product (包含 image URLs)
DB --> ProductSvc : 返回 productId
ProductSvc -> ES : index product 数据
ES --> ProductSvc : 索引成功
ProductSvc --> APIGW : 创建成功 (productId)
APIGW --> Frontend : 返回创建成功信息
Frontend --> Client : 显示发布成功

note over ImageStore, CDN
  图片通过 OSS 存储并由 CDN 分发
end note

@enduml